From b79e107e0bc5d7f2e15246dfb588fa02c9a184ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FAROVITUS <farovitus@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 17:14:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] exynos: keep the HIDL dumpstate and unit tests out of the
 build

Lineage 24 (Android 17) removed the HIDL android.hardware.dumpstate@1.0
interface, and two unit test directories here link external/freetype's
libft2, which is no longer visible to them. Soong reads every Android.bp
in the tree, so these three directories stop the build before anything
compiles, although my device installs none of them:

- dumpstate: android.hardware.dumpstate@1.0-service.exynos depends on the
  removed interface.
- libhdr/unittest (CS_04_hdrdrvTest) and libdisplaycolor/unittest
  (CS_05_dqedriver) depend on //external/freetype:libft2.

An empty .find-ignore makes the file finder skip each directory, as the
ssp one already does.

Change-Id: Id3812178fa5aac4b43c1b8301b5823b5999f38ef
Signed-off-by: FAROVITUS <farovitus@gmail.com>
---
 dumpstate/.find-ignore                | 0
 libdisplaycolor/unittest/.find-ignore | 0
 libhdr/unittest/.find-ignore          | 0
 3 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 dumpstate/.find-ignore
 create mode 100644 libdisplaycolor/unittest/.find-ignore
 create mode 100644 libhdr/unittest/.find-ignore

diff --git a/dumpstate/.find-ignore b/dumpstate/.find-ignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
diff --git a/libdisplaycolor/unittest/.find-ignore b/libdisplaycolor/unittest/.find-ignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
diff --git a/libhdr/unittest/.find-ignore b/libhdr/unittest/.find-ignore
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..e69de29
-- 
2.34.1

